<import src="../../course-ratings/common.wxml" />
<view class="screen">
  <navigator class="link" url="/pages/course-comments/course-comments">课程评论独立回执恢复 →</navigator>
  <view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 课程评分</view>
  <view class="title">找课程，查看三个独立均分</view>
  <view class="notice">此处为新课程评分页面。只展示已核验来源；浏览校区不授予评分权限。</view>
  <template is="course-status" data="{{status,error,receiptStatus,hasSession,frozen,recoveryCourseId,recoveryScores,busy,restartRequired}}" />
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">搜索与筛选</view>
    <input class="course-field" value="{{searchDraft}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="按课程名称搜索" bindinput="onSearchInput" bindconfirm="onSearch" disabled="{{busy}}" />
    <picker range="{{departmentLabels}}" value="{{departmentIndex}}" bindchange="onDepartment" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="filter-picker">{{departmentLabels[departmentIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
    <input class="course-field" value="{{categoryDraft}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="按完整类别筛选" bindinput="onCategoryInput" bindconfirm="onSearch" disabled="{{busy}}" />
    <view class="notice">院系与类别互斥，选择其中一个会清空另一个。“旧分类 90–99 分组”仅包含来源编号 90 至 99。</view>
    <view class="scores"><button data-sort="rating" bindtap="onSort" class="{{sortDraft === 'rating' ? 'score-selected' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy}}">综合均分排序</button><button data-sort="time" bindtap="onSort" class="{{sortDraft === 'time' ? 'score-selected' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy}}">时间排序</button></view>
    <button bindtap="onSearch" disabled="{{busy}}">查询课程</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{loaded}}">
    <view class="meta">{{appliedFilter}} · 第 {{pageNumber}} 页</view>
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card">
      <template is="course-facts" data="{{course:item}}" />
      <template is="course-summary" data="{{summary:item.summary}}" />
      <button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCourse" disabled="{{busy}}">查看课程与我的评分 →</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">当前查询已确认没有课程。</view>
    <button wx:if="{{canNext}}" bindtap="onNext" disabled="{{busy}}">下一页课程</button>
  </block>
  <view class="notice">每个账号每门课仅保留首次评分，不能修改或删除。身份会话、已验证手机号与当前安全状态分别由服务器核验。</view>
</view>
